Package: model.parameters.pipeline
Type: Package
Title: Performs transformations according to model parameters
Version: 0.2.3
Date: 2026-01-08
Description: The Model Parameters Pipeline is an R package for applying
  transformations to data according to the Model Parameters specification
  developed by Big Life Lab. This package implements a pipeline for sequential
  data transformations including centering, dummy coding, interactions,
  restricted cubic splines (RCS), and logistic regression.
